SUMMARY:Matt Rife: Stay Golden World Tour LIVE at Greek Theatre (July 11)
DTSTAMP:20260711T054927Z
DTSTART:20260711T193000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nComedy’s biggest social media 
	phenomenon\, Matt Rife\, brings his record-breaking Stay Golden World Tour
	 to the legendary Greek Theatre in Los Angeles for two special nights — Ju
	ly 11 & 12\, 2026. \nKnown for his viral TikTok clips\, Netflix special Na
	tural Selection\, and his massive sold-out arena tours\, Matt Rife is one 
	of the hottest stand-up comedians in the world right now. This is the Satu
	rday night show — July 11. \nAbout the Greek Theatre\nThe Greek Theatre is
	 one of Los Angeles’ most beloved and iconic outdoor amphitheaters\, nestl
	ed in Griffith Park at 2700 N Vermont Ave. With a capacity of 5\,900 and s
	tunning natural surroundings\, it offers an unmatched open-air summer conc
	ert experience under the stars. \nA warm July night at the Greek Theatre w
	atching one of comedy’s biggest stars — it doesn’t get more LA than that. 
	\nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up from one of the world’s most popu
	lar comedians\nBeautiful outdoor amphitheater setting in Griffith Park\n18
	+ / Mature Audience — valid ID required\nPreferred parking available — pur
	chase in advance\nSunday July 12 show also available — check Ticketmaster 
	for both dates\n\nEvent Details\n\nDate: Saturday\, July 11\, 2026\nTime: 
	7:30 PM PDT\nVenue: Greek Theatre\, 2700 N Vermont Ave\, Los Angeles\, CA 
	90027\nTour: Stay Golden World Tour\nAge Restriction: 18+ / Mature Audienc
	e\n\nTickets\nPrice: From $91 + fees (resale prices vary) \nOfficial Ticke
	tsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commi
	ssion at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/matt-ri
	fe-stay-golden-world-tour-live-at-greek-theatre-july-eleven/\n\nFrom Comed
	y Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/matt-rife-stay-golden-world-tour-live-
	at-greek-theatre-july-eleven/
LOCATION:Greek Theater\, 2700 N Vermont Ave.\, Los Angeles\, CA\, 90027\, U
	nited States
