	Goodyear Theater\nAddress: 1201 East Market Street\, Akron\, OH 44305\nAge
	 Requirement: 18+ Event\nParking: Available at nearby lots and parking dec
	ks \nAbout DC Young Fly\nDC Young Fly (John Whitfield) is an Atlanta-born 
