SUMMARY:Brian Regan LIVE at Palazzo Theatre at The Venetian Resort
DTSTAMP:20260711T054927Z
DTSTART:20260711T210000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Perfor
	mer\nBrian Regan is one of the most beloved and respected stand-up comedia
	ns in America — a master of clean\, brilliantly crafted observational come
	dy that has earned him a devoted following spanning generations. Known for
	 his elastic facial expressions\, impeccable timing\, and ability to find 
	hilarity in the most mundane moments of everyday life\, Brian Regan is wid
	ely regarded as a comedian’s comedian. \nWith multiple acclaimed stand-up 
	specials including On the Rocks (Netflix)\, Nunchucks and Flamethrowers\, 
	and Standing Up\, Brian has proven time and again that great comedy doesn’
	t need to be edgy to be brilliant. His shows are a masterclass in the art 
	of stand-up — perfectly constructed bits delivered with the kind of physic
	al comedy and vocal range that few performers can match. \nThis one-night-
	only performance at the Palazzo Theatre at The Venetian Resort is a rare L
	as Vegas appearance from one of comedy’s true legends. \nEvent Details\n\n
	Date: Saturday\, July 11\, 2026\nTime: 9:00 PM\nVenue: Palazzo Theatre at 
	The Venetian Resort\nAddress: 3355 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV 89109
	\nNote: One night only\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Palazzo Theatre at The Vene
	tian Resort is one of Las Vegas’s premier mid-size entertainment venues\, 
	located inside the iconic Venetian Resort at 3355 S Las Vegas Blvd. Seatin
	g approximately 1\,800 guests\, the theater is celebrated for its excellen
	t acoustics\, clear sightlines from every seat\, and intimate atmosphere t
	hat makes every comedy show feel personal. \nThe Palazzo Theatre has becom
	e one of Las Vegas’s go-to destinations for world-class stand-up comedy\, 
	hosting legends like Brian Regan\, Mark Normand\, Iliza Shlesinger\, and m
	any more. Its layout ensures that whether you’re in the front row or the b
	ack\, you’ll have a great view of the stage. \nValet and self-parking are 
	available at The Venetian Resort. The resort offers world-class dining\, s
	hopping\, and casino entertainment\, making it easy to build a full Las Ve
	gas evening around the show. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a solo stand-up per
	formance by Brian Regan — one night only at the Palazzo Theatre. The show 
	runs approximately 90 minutes and features Brian’s signature observational
	 humor\, delivered with the physical comedy\, vocal range\, and comedic pr
	ecision that have made him one of the most acclaimed stand-up comedians of
	 his generation. \nBrian Regan’s live shows are known for their warmth\, i
	ntelligence\, and the sheer joy of watching a true craftsman at work. His 
	comedy is accessible to all ages and backgrounds\, making this a perfect s
	how for date nights\, family outings\, or any comedy fan looking for a tru
	ly great night out. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $84 – $300 \nTicket
	s available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). Grab 
	your seats before they sell out! \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets\n\nhttps
	://comedycalendar.com/event/brian-regan-live-palazzo-theatre-venetian-las-
	vegas-july/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/brian-regan-live-palazzo-theatre-venet
	ian-las-vegas-july/
LOCATION:Palazzo Theatre at The Venetian Resort\, 3355 S Las Vegas Blvd\, L
	as Vegas\, NV\, 89109\, USA
