SUMMARY:Jeff Allen LIVE at Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club
DTSTAMP:20260711T054927Z
DTSTART:20260712T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout Jeff Allen\nJeff Allen i
	s one of America’s most beloved comedians\, with nearly 1 billion online v
	iews and a record-setting seven Dry Bar Comedy specials to his name. Known
	 for his warm\, family-friendly humor and his signature Happy Wife Happy L
	ife routine\, Jeff has built a massive following across generations of com
	edy fans. \nAt 69 years old\, Jeff Allen is embarking on his My First Fina
	l Farewell Tour — a tongue-in-cheek nod to the fact that he’s not quite re
	ady to hang up the microphone. The tour blends fan-favorite material with 
	fresh new content\, delivering a night that is hilarious\, heartfelt\, and
	 deeply uplifting. \nJeff has been featured on America’s Got Talent\, The 
	Today Show\, Comedy Central\, and Showtime\, and starred in the films Apos
	tles of Comedy and My 7 Grandmas. With millions of followers across Facebo
	ok\, Instagram\, TikTok\, and YouTube\, Jeff Allen is a comedy institution
	 — but nothing compares to seeing him live. \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\
	, July 12\, 2026\nShow Time: 7:00 PM CDT\nDoors Open: 6:00 PM CDT\nVenue: 
	Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club\nAddress: 618 NW Loop 410\, San Antonio\, TX 78
	216\nAge Restriction: 18+ Event\nTicket Prices: $35 – $45 (plus fees) \nAb
	out the Venue\nThe Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club is San Antonio’s premier sta
	nd-up comedy destination\, conveniently located in Park North Plaza at Loo
	p 410 and Blanco — just inside the loop and only minutes from the airport.
	 The intimate club setting creates an electric atmosphere where every seat
	 feels close to the action. \nThe venue features tiered seating sections i
	ncluding Preferred center-stage tables and General Admission side-stage ta
	bles — all first come\, first served within each section. The full-service
	 bar lounge is the perfect place to grab a drink before the show\, and the
	 two-item food or beverage minimum per person ensures a full dining experi
	ence during the performance. \nWith a capacity designed for an intimate co
	medy experience\, the Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club delivers a close-up\, per
	sonal show environment that larger arenas simply can’t match. Parking is a
	vailable in the Park North Plaza lot. The venue enforces an 18% service ch
	arge on all checks in the showroom. \nWhat to Expect\nJeff Allen’s live sh
	ow is a warm\, hilarious\, and uplifting experience that resonates with au
	diences of all ages. His comedy draws from real life — marriage\, family\,
	 faith\, and the beautiful chaos of everyday existence — delivered with th
	e kind of masterful timing that only comes from decades on the road. \nThi
	s is a solo headlining performance as part of Jeff’s My First Final Farewe
	ll Tour. Expect a mix of beloved classics like Happy Wife Happy Life along
	side fresh new material. The intimate setting of the Laugh Out Loud Comedy
	 Club makes this an especially personal and memorable experience. \nPlease
	 note this is an 18+ event. All sales are final — no refunds or exchanges.
	 A two-item food or beverage minimum per person applies once seated. \nTic
	ket Information\nPrice Range: $35 – $45 per ticket (plus fees)\nPreferred 
	Seating (center stage): $45 (+fees)\nGeneral Admission (side stage): $35 (
	+fees) \nJeff Allen’s shows are beloved by fans nationwide — don’t miss yo
	ur chance to see him live in San Antonio! \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets
