DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nRussell Peters LIVE at Wind Creek Event Center\nOn
	e of the world’s most celebrated stand-up comedians\, Russell Peters\, bri
	ngs his highly anticipated Relax World Tour to the Wind Creek Event Center
	 in Bethlehem\, PA on Sunday\, July 12\, 2026. Known for his razor-sharp o
	bservational humor and electrifying stage presence\, Russell Peters delive
	rs a comedy experience unlike any other — don’t miss this unforgettable ni
	ght of laughter in the Lehigh Valley! \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, July
	 12\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM EDT\nVenue: Wind Creek Event Center\nAddress: 77
	 Sands Blvd.\, Bethlehem\, PA 18015\nParking: Available on-site at Wind Cr
	eek Bethlehem\nAge Requirement: All ages welcome \nAbout Russell Peters\nR
	ussell Peters is a Canadian stand-up comedian and actor who has become one
	 of the most successful comedians in the world\, selling out arenas across
	 six continents. Known for his sharp wit\, cultural observations\, and fea
	rless comedy style\, Peters has released multiple Netflix specials and has
	 performed for audiences of over 10\,000 people worldwide. His Relax World
	 Tour continues to break attendance records globally. \nWhat to Expect\n\n
	A world-class stand-up comedy performance from one of the biggest names in
	 comedy\nRussell Peters’ signature observational humor and cultural commen
	tary\nAn arena-scale show with top production values and lighting\nMateria
	l from his acclaimed Relax World Tour\nA high-energy performance that will
	 have the entire audience in stitches\nOne of the most anticipated comedy 
	events of the summer in the Lehigh Valley\n\nVenue Information\nWind Creek
	 Event Center is a premier entertainment venue located at 77 Sands Blvd. i
	n Bethlehem\, PA\, adjacent to Wind Creek Bethlehem casino and resort. The
	 state-of-the-art facility hosts world-class concerts\, comedy shows\, and
	 sporting events\, with ample parking and full amenities on-site. \nTicket
	 Information\nTickets for Russell Peters at Wind Creek Event Center are av
	ailable now. Resale tickets start at $92. Secure your seats early as this 
	show is expected to sell out. Tickets are non-refundable unless the event 
	is cancelled or postponed. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post 
	contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets thr
	ough our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times 
	subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://co
	medycalendar.com/event/russell-peters-live-at-wind-creek-event-center/\n\n
	From Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/russell-peters-live-at-wind-creek-even
	t-center/
