SUMMARY:"Weird Al" Yankovic: Bigger & Weirder 2026 Tour LIVE at Providence 
	Performing Arts Center
DTSTAMP:20260711T054927Z
DTSTART:20260714T193000Z
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \n“Weird Al” Yankovic: Bigger & Weirder 2026 Tour LI
	VE at Providence Performing Arts Center\nThe legendary “Weird Al” Yankovic
	 brings his spectacular Bigger & Weirder 2026 Tour to the Providence Perfo
	rming Arts Center on July 14\, 2026. The undisputed king of comedy music r
	eturns with an extravagant live show featuring his greatest parody hits\, 
	original songs\, and jaw-dropping costume changes. \nEvent Details\nDate: 
	Tuesday\, July 14\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM\nVenue: Providence Performing Arts
	 Center\nAddress: 220 Weybosset Street\, Providence\, RI 02903\nAge Requir
	ement: All Ages\nTicket Prices: Starting at $208 \nAbout “Weird Al” Yankov
	ic\n“Weird Al” Yankovic is the best-selling comedy recording artist of all
	 time\, with 5 Grammy Awards and over 12 million albums sold worldwide. Kn
	own for iconic parodies like “Eat It\,” “Amish Paradise\,” and “White & Ne
	rdy\,” Weird Al has been entertaining audiences for over four decades. His
	 2022 biopic “Weird: The Al Yankovic Story” introduced him to a whole new 
	generation of fans. \nWhat to Expect\n\nA spectacular full-production live
	 show with elaborate costumes\nClassic parody hits and beloved original so
	ngs\nMultiple costume changes and theatrical set pieces\nAll-ages family-f
	riendly entertainment\nOne of the most unique and entertaining live shows 
	in music and comedy\nA night of pure joy and laughter at the beautiful PPA
	C\n\nVenue Information\nThe Providence Performing Arts Center (PPAC) is Rh
	ode Island’s premier entertainment venue\, located at 220 Weybosset Street
	 in downtown Providence. The stunning 3\,200-seat theater is one of the la
	rgest performing arts centers in New England and offers a world-class expe
	rience for every performance. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $208 
	and are available now. This is an all-ages event. Purchase official ticket
	s through PPAC/Ticketmaster or find resale tickets on VividSeats. \nOffici
	al Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a
	 commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to 
	you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID ma
	y be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/weird-al-yank
	ovic-bigger-weirder-tour-live-at-providence-performing-arts-center/\n\nFro
	m Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/weird-al-yankovic-bigger-weirder-tour-
	live-at-providence-performing-arts-center/
LOCATION:Providence Performing Arts Center\, 220 Weybosset Street\, Provide
	nce\, RI\, 2903\, USA
